# A loft's side, a face no entity names, picked with the mouse on the
# model and taken away by Shell Solid; the same as path_shell_loft.go
# makes (TestPathEquivalenceShellLoftFace).
file $testdata/ui/loft_profiles.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
move 300 400
down L 300 400
up L 300 400
menu New Group|Loft To Selected Profile
move 320 375
down L 320 375
up L 320 375
menu New Group|Shell Solid
